program	errors/unsafe_static_needs_deinit.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	static `HELD` has type `Guard`, which owns a resource (Deinit); statics are immortal and never run deinit
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: static `HELD` has type `Guard`, which owns a resource (Deinit); statics are immortal and never run deinit"
log	"  --> examples/errors/unsafe_static_needs_deinit.saw:19:8"
log	"     |"
log	" 19 | unsafe static var HELD: Guard = Guard(id: 1)"
log	"     |        ^"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
